# Paths Orbit leaves out of this repository's session checkouts
# (docs/session-checkout-storage-design.md section 6, decision D6).
# One pattern a line in gitignore syntax; a line starting with ! brings a path back in.
#
# docs/mocks/ and docs/evidence/ are left out, except what a test, script, build or
# CI job reads and what the public guides link to (npm run docs:check opens those).
# A path a test starts reading goes back in here, with its reader named above it.
# In a session checkout, `git sparse-checkout add <path>` brings a path in for that
# checkout alone.

